@startuml

title US11 - Register Parameter\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

' =====================================================
' Main Success Scenario
' =====================================================

Admin -> System : Requests parameter registration

System --> Admin : Requests parameter information

Admin -> System : Provides code, name, description\nand metric

System --> Admin : Requests metric classification\n(1 - Numeric; 2 - Qualitative)

Admin -> System : Selects metric classification\n(1 or 2)

' =====================================================
' Optional Reference Values
' =====================================================

opt Numeric metric (Option 1) and reference values requested

    System --> Admin : Requests minimum and maximum\nreference values

    Admin -> System : Provides minimum and maximum\nreference values

end

' =====================================================
' Successful Registration
' =====================================================

System --> Admin : Confirms successful parameter registration

' =====================================================
' Acceptance Criteria
' =====================================================

note right of System
AC11-1:
The parameter code must
contain exactly five
alphanumeric characters
and must be unique.

AC11-2:
Reference values are only
applicable to numeric metrics.

Metric classification:
1 - Numeric
2 - Qualitative (Non-numeric)
end note

@enduml